---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="PhotoEditingPrompt.com Android App – Coming Soon" desc="The PhotoEditingPrompt.com Android app is coming soon: browse, save and copy free ChatGPT and Gemini photo editing prompts from your phone.">
  <div class="narrow">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › App</nav>
    <h1 class="page-title" style="font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px);margin:28px 0 20px">Android app coming soon 📱</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>We are building the {SITE.name} Android app, so you can browse, save and copy free photo editing prompts for ChatGPT and Gemini straight from your phone.</p>
      <h2>What to expect</h2>
      <p>Every prompt from this website, one-tap copy, and your saved favourites in one place. The app will be free.</p>
      <p>Until it is ready, this website works well on any phone: open a prompt, tap Copy, and paste it into ChatGPT or Gemini along with your photo. Tell us what you would like in the app on the <a class="link" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
